OL,3,AHarper Lee first edition novel found in
OL,4,AOxfam shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FShop manager Olivia Haysman-Walker, who
OL,7,Fidentified the copy as being a first US
OL,8,Fedition, said the book could easily
OL,9,Fhave been missed. "There were lots of
OL,10,Fbooks to work through in the donation,
OL,11,Fbut we recognised To Kill A Mockingbird
OL,12,Fand thought it was worth taking a
OL,13,Fcloser look."
